{"sha": "fe823cfbbf6af48d597b475eb811c004655357e37dadb88b7f921e0823593d27", "body": ["\\begin{proposition}[强酸的 pH]\\label{prop:g12:ka-and-pka:strong}", "浓度为 $c$（不太稀）的强酸溶液，", "$[\\ce{H3O+}] = c$，$\\mathrm{pH} = -\\log(c/c^\\circ)$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "反应 \\ce{HA + H2O -> A- + H3O+} 进行完全：每个酸分子", "生成一个水合氢离子。水自身电离产生的离子可以忽略，", "只要 $c$ 远大于 \\qty{e-7}{mol/L}。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[盐酸]\\label{ex:g12:ka-and-pka:hcl}", "盐酸浓度为 \\qty{0.010}{mol/L}：$[\\ce{H3O+}] = \\qty{0.010}{mol/L}$", "且 $\\mathrm{pH} = -\\log 0.010 = 2.0$。稀释十倍后，pH 为 3.0。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{水与离子积}", "", "", "\\begin{definition}[水的离子积]\\label{def:g12:ka-and-pka:ionic-product}", "水自身发生的反应极其微弱：\\ce{2H2O <=> H3O+ + OH-}。", "该反应的平衡常数称为\\emph{水的", "离子积}\\index{水的离子积}：", "\\[", "  K_e = \\frac{[\\ce{H3O+}]\\,[\\ce{OH-}]}{(c^\\circ)^2},", "  \\qquad pK_e = -\\log K_e .", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[中性水与强碱]\\label{prop:g12:ka-and-pka:ke}", "% ledger: ke:25C", "在 \\qty{25}{\\celsius} 时，$K_e = \\num{1.0e-14}$，$pK_e = 14.0$。纯", "水中 $[\\ce{H3O+}] = [\\ce{OH-}] = \\qty{1.0e-7}{mol/L}$，pH 为 7.0。", "强碱浓度为 $c$ 时，$[\\ce{OH-}] = c$，于是", "$[\\ce{H3O+}] = K_e (c^\\circ)^2 / c$，$\\mathrm{pH} = 14.0 + \\log(c/c^\\circ)$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "纯水中两种离子成对产生，因此二者相等，它们的", "乘积为 $\\num{1.0e-14}$，各为 \\qty{1.0e-7}{mol/L}。对于碱，", "溶液中 $K_e$ 仍然成立：", "$-\\log([\\ce{H3O+}]/c^\\circ) = -\\log K_e + \\log(c/c^\\circ)$.", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[氢氧化钠]\\label{ex:g12:ka-and-pka:naoh}", "氢氧化钠浓度为 \\qty{0.010}{mol/L}：$[\\ce{OH-}] = 0.010$，于是", "$[\\ce{H3O+}] = \\num{1.0e-14}/0.010 = \\qty{1.0e-12}{mol/L}$，pH 为 12.0。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{酸度常数}", "", "\\begin{definition}[酸度常数，$pK_a$]\\label{def:g12:ka-and-pka:ka}", "\\emph{酸度常数}\\index{酸度常数} $K_a$ 为酸碱共轭对", "\\ce{HA}/\\ce{A-} 的酸与水反应的", "平衡常数，即 \\ce{HA + H2O <=> A- + H3O+}：", "\\[", "  K_a = \\frac{[\\ce{A-}]\\,[\\ce{H3O+}]}{[\\ce{HA}]\\,c^\\circ} .", "\\]", "该共轭对的\\emph{pKa}\\index{pKa} 为", "$pK_a = -\\log K_a$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[$pK_a$ 越小，酸越强]\\label{prop:g12:ka-and-pka:compare}", "在浓度相同的两种弱酸中，", "$K_a$ 较大（即 $pK_a$ 较小）的那种与水反应更多，", "溶液的 pH 更低；其共轭碱则更弱。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$K_a$ 越大，平衡时 \\ce{A-} 与 \\ce{H3O+} 越多，", "对于同一 \\ce{HA}。易放出氢离子的酸，其共轭碱 \\ce{A-}", "则较难再结合氢离子。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, y=0.55cm]", "  % ledger: pka:methanoic, pka:ethanoic, pka:benzoic, pka:ascorbic1, ka:HF, ka:H2CO3, ka:HCO3, kb:NH3, ke:25C", "  \\draw[->, thick] (0,0) -- (0,14.8) node[above] {$pK_a$};", "  \\foreach \\k in {0,2,4,6,8,10,12,14} \\draw (-0.1,\\k) -- (0.1,\\k) node[right, font=\\scriptsize] {\\k};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize\\bfseries, anchor=south] at (-3.0,14.3) {酸};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize\\bfseries, anchor=south] at (3.0,14.3) {碱};", "  \\foreach \\p/\\yl/\\acid/\\base in {3.19/2.9/{\\ce{HF}}/{\\ce{F-}},", "      3.74/3.6/{\\ce{HCOOH}}/{\\ce{HCOO-}}, 4.04/4.3/{ascorbic acid}/{ascorbate},", "      4.20/5.0/{\\ce{C6H5COOH}}/{\\ce{C6H5COO-}}, 4.76/5.7/{\\ce{CH3COOH}}/{\\ce{CH3COO-}},", "      6.37/6.9/{\\ce{CO2,H2O}}/{\\ce{HCO3-}}, 9.26/9.26/{\\ce{NH4+}}/{\\ce{NH3}},", "      10.33/10.4/{\\ce{HCO3-}}/{\\ce{CO3^{2-}}}} {", "    \\draw[omDef] (-0.25,\\p) -- (0.25,\\p);", "    \\draw[black!40] (-0.25,\\p) -- (-1.1,\\yl);", "    \\draw[black!40] (0.25,\\p) -- (1.1,\\yl);", "    \\node[anchor=east, font=\\scriptsize] at (-1.15,\\yl) {\\acid};", "    \\node[anchor=west, font=\\scriptsize] at (1.15,\\yl) {\\base};", "  }", "  \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (-4.6,13) -- (-4.6,1);", "  \\node[omThm, rotate=90, font=\\footnotesize] at (-4.95,7) {较强的酸};", "  \\draw[->, omMeth, thick] (4.6,1) -- (4.6,13);", "  \\node[omMeth, rotate=90, font=\\footnotesize] at (4.95,7) {较强的碱};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 若干共轭对按其 $pK_a$ 排列（\\qty{25}{\\celsius}），酸在左，", "碱在右。位置越低，其酸越强；越高，", "其碱越强。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "", "\\begin{method}[弱酸的 pH]\\label{met:g12:ka-and-pka:weak}", "设弱酸浓度为 $c$、酸度常数为 $K_a$：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 按每升计，写出 \\ce{HA + H2O <=> A- + H3O+} 的进度表，", "        其中 $x = [\\ce{H3O+}]$，$[\\ce{HA}] = c - x$，$[\\ce{A-}] = x$", "        （忽略水自身电离产生的离子）。", "  \\item 解方程 $\\dfrac{x^2}{(c - x)\\,c^\\circ} = K_a$，即二次方程", "        $x^2 + K_a c^\\circ x - K_a c^\\circ c = 0$，", "        并取其正根。", "  \\item $\\mathrm{pH} = -\\log(x/c^\\circ)$；检验 $x$ 远大于", "        \\qty{e-7}{mol/L}。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", ""]}